WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:06.214
<i>It appeared as if humanity will soon
be destroyed by the demons.</i>

2
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.889
<i>But there was a mage who fought alone
and saved everyone.</i>

3
00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:26.776
<i>He was called the Magic Emperor
and became a legend.</i>

4
00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.948
This is the Black Market.

5
00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:34.492
This place is a little dangerous.

6
00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:38.121
but it has great magic tools
that are super effective.

7
00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:40.665
Damn it! I lost again.

8
00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:46.087
That's because I can see the future.

9
00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.506
That old lady is really good.

10
00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:52.343
Anyway. it's not the time for this now.

11
00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:55.430
She's so cute!

12
00:00:56.598 --> 00:01:01.144
The Black Market doesn't seem
like a place for pretty girls like you.

13
00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:03.563
Get lost. you flying insect.

14
00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:08.651
Hey! I found an interesting item!

15
00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.072
<i>This little brat...</i>

16
00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.866
Wait. Aren't you Haha?

17
00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:16.659
I'm Sekke! Not Haha!

18
00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.411
Haha. how have you been?

19
00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:20.455
I told you! I'm Haha...

20
00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:21.915
No. I mean. Sekke!

21
00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.208
Who is he?

22
00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:25.877
Someone I met at the entrance exam.

23
00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.463
I see. He's a member of the Green Mantis.

24
00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:32.342
<i>Are these two pretty ladies with him?</i>

25
00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:33.468
<i>If so.</i>

26
00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.304
<i>these two must be members
of the Black Bull.</i>

27
00:01:36.554 --> 00:01:37.931
<i>Asta. you bastard.</i>

28
00:01:38.014 --> 00:01:41.017
<i>Despite being in the Black Bull.
you're making me jealous.</i>

29
00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:42.685
<i>Come to think of it.</i>

30
00:01:42.852 --> 00:01:47.690
<i>it's all your fault that I ended up
in the Green Mantis.</i>

31
00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:51.361
<i>How infuriating.</i>

32
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:59.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

33
00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:23.328
<i>You're out shopping with the girls?</i>

34
00:03:23.453 --> 00:03:25.330
<i>Well. since today's our day off.</i>

35
00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:27.415
<i>You sure know how to have a good time.</i>

36
00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.084
Even if it's your day off.
instead of messing around.

37
00:03:30.168 --> 00:03:33.755
don't you think it's better to do
some odd jobs and earn some points?

38
00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.507
I heard that the Black Bull
have negative stars.

39
00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:37.467
Stars!

40
00:03:37.592 --> 00:03:38.968
That's right! Listen to this!

41
00:03:39.093 --> 00:03:42.847
I got a star from the Magic Emperor
on my first mission!

42
00:03:42.972 --> 00:03:46.643
<i>What? You must be kidding!</i>

43
00:03:47.143 --> 00:03:49.854
Well. both of them did a very good job.

44
00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:53.233
<i>They're serious?</i>

45
00:03:53.816 --> 00:03:55.693
<i>No. I should calm down.</i>

46
00:03:58.488 --> 00:04:01.574
I see! Seems like you're working hard.

47
00:04:01.699 --> 00:04:02.951
What about you. Haha?

48
00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:04.410
It's Sekke!

49
00:04:04.535 --> 00:04:07.664
Just the other day.
I got my second star...

50
00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:08.748
No. potato.

51
00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.592
Thief!

52
00:04:19.717 --> 00:04:21.594
My winning prize!

53
00:04:21.719 --> 00:04:24.264
Stop right there!

54
00:04:29.227 --> 00:04:30.853
It's that old lady.

55
00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:40.113
He's sure got some nerve
to steal in front of Magic Knights.

56
00:04:40.238 --> 00:04:41.614
Indeed.

57
00:04:41.739 --> 00:04:44.033
I'm sure we can just leave it to that kid.

58
00:04:44.158 --> 00:04:45.785
I'm counting on you.

59
00:04:47.078 --> 00:04:50.373
I'm not going to let you
take all the limelight. Asta!

60
00:04:50.498 --> 00:04:52.166
Bronze Creation Magic.

61
00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.003
Sekke's Shooting Star!

62
00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:57.630
-Lame!
-Gross!

63
00:04:58.506 --> 00:05:00.091
Leave this to me.

64
00:05:00.258 --> 00:05:03.761
You lovely ladies and that old lady
can just sit back and wait.

65
00:05:04.929 --> 00:05:06.514
-So dirty!
-No!

66
00:05:10.059 --> 00:05:12.020
Stop right there!

67
00:05:14.522 --> 00:05:16.858
Try and catch me if you can.

68
00:05:17.025 --> 00:05:18.985
Stop there!

69
00:05:23.281 --> 00:05:24.282
Stop!

70
00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:30.997
Yes?

71
00:05:33.249 --> 00:05:35.335
I'm sorry!

72
00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:38.713
I finally got rid of him.

73
00:05:39.047 --> 00:05:40.882
It's not over yet!

74
00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:42.383
He's so persistent!

75
00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.848
I can't see!

76
00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.648
I won't let you get away!

77
00:05:57.774 --> 00:05:59.108
How is he catching up with me

78
00:05:59.233 --> 00:06:01.152
when he's only running?

79
00:06:01.486 --> 00:06:04.614
This is not going to end
if I don't do something about that cloud.

80
00:06:05.073 --> 00:06:06.866
If it's a cloud created by magic...

81
00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:08.076
Okay!

82
00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:15.458
Do you seriously think you can
cut through my Bandit's Cloud Wind--

83
00:06:17.335 --> 00:06:18.878
What?

84
00:06:20.838 --> 00:06:23.883
You're not getting away!

85
00:06:29.931 --> 00:06:31.182
Haha?

86
00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:33.684
I'm taking the credit!

87
00:06:33.976 --> 00:06:35.895
That is so cool!

88
00:06:42.443 --> 00:06:43.611
You're under arrest!

89
00:06:43.736 --> 00:06:45.488
The credit is all mine!

90
00:06:54.831 --> 00:06:55.790
That's...

91
00:06:55.915 --> 00:06:58.042
Stop laughing! It's annoying!

92
00:06:58.167 --> 00:07:01.337
I'm taking you down with me.

93
00:07:08.052 --> 00:07:09.303
What's wrong. Haha?

94
00:07:13.099 --> 00:07:14.517
Poison.

95
00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:17.770
The poison's coursing through my body.

96
00:07:17.937 --> 00:07:20.481
Hang in there. Haha!

97
00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:26.737
<i>Am I going to die?</i>

98
00:07:27.029 --> 00:07:28.865
<i>Now that I think about it. I was once...</i>

99
00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:31.951
<i>trying to get to the top too.</i>

100
00:07:32.034 --> 00:07:33.870
Haha!

101
00:07:35.246 --> 00:07:38.332
<i>Should I entrust it to him?</i>

102
00:07:40.084 --> 00:07:42.795
You're the man who defeated me.

103
00:07:43.129 --> 00:07:46.799
Make it all the way to the top
for my sake too.

104
00:07:47.258 --> 00:07:48.718
I'm entrusting

105
00:07:48.926 --> 00:07:50.219
my dream to you!

106
00:07:50.344 --> 00:07:51.679
Haha.

107
00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.394
<i>I guess having an ending like this</i>

108
00:07:58.603 --> 00:08:01.105
<i>isn't so bad.</i>

109
00:08:05.276 --> 00:08:06.402
Haha?

110
00:08:06.569 --> 00:08:08.779
Haha!

111
00:08:11.532 --> 00:08:12.617
<i>What?</i>

112
00:08:13.075 --> 00:08:14.577
<i>I'm not dead.</i>

113
00:08:19.248 --> 00:08:20.666
What are you doing?

114
00:08:21.292 --> 00:08:24.670
Don't entrust something
so important to anyone so easily!

115
00:08:25.004 --> 00:08:28.299
Survive and make your own dream come true!

116
00:08:28.466 --> 00:08:30.885
Don't give up. you idiot!

117
00:08:32.595 --> 00:08:36.015
Jeez. there's no way
you would die from this.

118
00:08:37.308 --> 00:08:39.977
It's just some temporary irritant poison.

119
00:08:40.394 --> 00:08:43.648
Apply this Shique ointment
and you'll be better in no time.

120
00:08:50.404 --> 00:08:54.242
Keep improving yourself
until the next time we meet. Asta!

121
00:08:54.492 --> 00:08:55.618
See you!

122
00:08:57.203 --> 00:08:59.205
See you. Haha!

123
00:08:59.497 --> 00:09:03.209
<i>Little Boy may look younger
than him on the outside.</i>

124
00:09:03.334 --> 00:09:06.462
<i>but he's definitely stronger
on the inside.</i>

125
00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.634
Don't let it get taken again. Granny.

126
00:09:13.553 --> 00:09:16.806
Thank you. Magic Knights.

127
00:09:16.973 --> 00:09:18.724
See you. Granny.

128
00:09:18.891 --> 00:09:20.059
Be careful.

129
00:09:20.184 --> 00:09:21.978
May you live a long life.

130
00:09:26.732 --> 00:09:29.360
Nullification of magic?

131
00:09:29.527 --> 00:09:33.364
That's a type of magic
I've never seen before.

132
00:09:36.367 --> 00:09:39.704
Strictly speaking. is that even magic?

133
00:09:40.997 --> 00:09:44.667
Yami sure took in an interesting kid.

134
00:09:45.167 --> 00:09:48.713
This is why I can't stop wandering
around in disguise.

135
00:09:50.339 --> 00:09:52.550
I finally found you!

136
00:09:52.675 --> 00:09:54.343
What are you doing here?

137
00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:55.469
Magic Emperor.

138
00:09:55.595 --> 00:09:57.054
{\an8}28TH MAGIC EMPEROR. JULIUS NOVACHRONO

139
00:09:57.179 --> 00:09:58.347
{\an8}What am I doing?

140
00:09:58.472 --> 00:10:00.600
{\an8}I'm strolling through the castle town.

141
00:10:00.725 --> 00:10:02.602
{\an8}hoping to come across new magic.

142
00:10:02.727 --> 00:10:03.978
What?

143
00:10:04.061 --> 00:10:06.814
Are you aware of your own position?

144
00:10:06.939 --> 00:10:09.859
Encounters with magic
are once in a lifetime.

145
00:10:09.984 --> 00:10:10.818
<i>That's why I said--</i>

146
00:10:10.943 --> 00:10:14.113
<i>You never know what kind of magic
you're going to encounter or where.</i>

147
00:10:14.238 --> 00:10:17.033
<i>Listen to me. you magic maniac!</i>

148
00:10:17.158 --> 00:10:20.161
Calm down. will you. Marx?

149
00:10:22.079 --> 00:10:26.208
Isn't that the new kid
from William's squad?

150
00:10:29.211 --> 00:10:30.379
Well then.

151
00:10:30.463 --> 00:10:33.215
I'm off to encounter even more new magic.

152
00:10:33.341 --> 00:10:34.884
I'll be right back.

153
00:10:36.427 --> 00:10:38.262
Hold on!

154
00:10:45.311 --> 00:10:46.687
{\an8}MEMBER OF THE GOLDEN DAWN. KLAUS LUNNETTES

155
00:10:46.771 --> 00:10:49.732
{\an8}<i>Yuno. Golden Dawn's newbie.</i>

156
00:10:50.274 --> 00:10:52.151
{\an8}<i>The genius that
every captain of Magic Knights</i>

157
00:10:52.234 --> 00:10:54.904
{\an8}<i>wanted in their squads.</i>

158
00:10:56.280 --> 00:11:00.034
{\an8}<i>And Mimosa Vermillion.
a royal who is also a newbie.</i>

159
00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.912
<i>Their first mission together</i>

160
00:11:05.122 --> 00:11:07.750
<i>is to act as bodyguards
for Salim Hapshass?</i>

161
00:11:09.669 --> 00:11:12.296
Escorting the son of Lord Hapshass
of the House of Lords.

162
00:11:12.421 --> 00:11:15.758
to our ally. the Heart Kingdom?

163
00:11:16.926 --> 00:11:19.220
You know who Lord Hapshass is. don't you?

164
00:11:19.345 --> 00:11:20.596
I've only heard of his name.

165
00:11:20.971 --> 00:11:24.183
Since he's an upstart noble.

166
00:11:24.308 --> 00:11:26.519
he doesn't quite have a good reputation.

167
00:11:27.395 --> 00:11:28.729
That's why

168
00:11:28.979 --> 00:11:32.024
he's worried that his son.
who's going to study in the Heart Kingdom.

169
00:11:32.149 --> 00:11:35.277
might be targeted by some bandits.

170
00:11:35.986 --> 00:11:40.991
But there are many powerful mages
among his own family.

171
00:11:41.867 --> 00:11:45.371
He feels more reassured to have
the famous Magic Knights

172
00:11:45.704 --> 00:11:47.039
as bodyguards.

173
00:11:47.998 --> 00:11:50.167
Lord Hapshass makes
very generous donations

174
00:11:50.251 --> 00:11:52.461
to the Magic Knights every year.

175
00:11:53.087 --> 00:11:56.006
so as a civil servant.
I couldn't just refuse.

176
00:11:56.257 --> 00:11:57.258
Are you reluctant to do it?

177
00:11:57.383 --> 00:11:58.467
No!

178
00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:01.846
We must fulfill every kind of mission.

179
00:12:02.012 --> 00:12:04.932
This is also for the sake
of the Clover Kingdom.

180
00:12:05.057 --> 00:12:07.017
Yes. I understand.

181
00:12:07.184 --> 00:12:09.103
Take Mimosa with you too.

182
00:12:09.979 --> 00:12:13.107
The three of you. including you
as their mentor. are enough for the job.

183
00:12:14.191 --> 00:12:17.528
I'll leave the newbies to your care.

184
00:12:19.947 --> 00:12:24.952
<i>Salim Hapshass lost to Yuno
in the final round of the Entrance Exam</i>

185
00:12:25.286 --> 00:12:28.831
<i>and ended up being unable
to join the Magic Knights.</i>

186
00:12:29.248 --> 00:12:32.835
<i>So why did he appoint Yuno
to be one of his bodyguards?</i>

187
00:12:33.544 --> 00:12:36.213
It's my first mission and I'm so nervous.

188
00:12:36.714 --> 00:12:40.342
Mr. Klaus. Yuno. it's a pleasure
to work with you.

189
00:12:40.968 --> 00:12:41.969
Yes.

190
00:12:42.595 --> 00:12:44.096
Don't let your guard down. Mimosa.

191
00:12:44.221 --> 00:12:45.681
Yes!

192
00:12:45.806 --> 00:12:47.016
You too.

193
00:12:47.183 --> 00:12:48.434
I know.

194
00:12:48.851 --> 00:12:50.853
<i>What an insolent newbie.</i>

195
00:12:55.941 --> 00:12:58.694
How have you been. Yuno?

196
00:13:00.279 --> 00:13:03.365
Don't make that scary face.

197
00:13:03.657 --> 00:13:08.078
I requested you as my bodyguard
because I wanted to apologize.

198
00:13:08.746 --> 00:13:11.040
Your goal is to become
the Magic Emperor. isn't it?

199
00:13:12.082 --> 00:13:14.001
How did you know?

200
00:13:14.418 --> 00:13:16.587
All of the captains raised their hands.

201
00:13:16.712 --> 00:13:18.464
You could've joined any squad.

202
00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:21.050
and you ended up choosing the Golden Dawn.

203
00:13:21.342 --> 00:13:23.552
so I figured that must be why.

204
00:13:24.136 --> 00:13:26.096
I'm sure you'll do
an outstanding job from now on.

205
00:13:26.222 --> 00:13:30.601
and your name will spread
throughout the entire kingdom.

206
00:13:30.893 --> 00:13:34.230
Everyone will know you
as Yuno of the Clover Grimoire.

207
00:13:35.814 --> 00:13:39.360
Make sure your dream of becoming
the Magic Emperor comes true.

208
00:13:39.485 --> 00:13:43.656
That way. I'll be able to brag
to my future children

209
00:13:44.031 --> 00:13:47.243
that I once fought the Magic Emperor.

210
00:13:47.368 --> 00:13:51.497
And then they'll say.
"Father. you're so cool!"

211
00:13:51.997 --> 00:13:54.917
There's still some distance to go
before we reach the Heart Kingdom.

212
00:13:55.167 --> 00:13:58.212
If you don't mind.
could you tell me about yourself?

213
00:13:58.712 --> 00:14:00.673
I won't force you to
if you don't feel like it.

214
00:14:00.756 --> 00:14:03.008
I'm from Hage Village.

215
00:14:06.929 --> 00:14:08.430
I've heard of it.

216
00:14:08.931 --> 00:14:10.933
It's the most remote village. isn't it?

217
00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:14.645
I think that's where the legend
about the first Magic Emperor

218
00:14:14.728 --> 00:14:16.814
defeating the demons comes from.

219
00:14:17.231 --> 00:14:18.649
It's not just a legend.

220
00:14:19.191 --> 00:14:22.194
In fact. a giant skull of the demon
is still there.

221
00:14:22.361 --> 00:14:23.279
Really?

222
00:14:23.737 --> 00:14:28.075
I was abandoned at the door
of a church when I was young.

223
00:14:29.326 --> 00:14:33.664
I've never seen my parents.
and no one knows who they are.

224
00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:36.417
Though the church was poor.

225
00:14:36.792 --> 00:14:39.879
the priest and sisters there
took care of us well.

226
00:14:40.296 --> 00:14:42.006
-I'm very grateful to them.
<i>-No problems so far.</i>

227
00:14:42.131 --> 00:14:46.302
<i>but there must be someone in the Hapshass
family who can use transportation magic.</i>

228
00:14:46.677 --> 00:14:47.928
<i>Why go through all this trouble?</i>

229
00:14:48.512 --> 00:14:50.556
<i>Not to mention
that we're the only bodyguards.</i>

230
00:14:51.223 --> 00:14:53.684
<i>If they were really worried
about the bandits.</i>

231
00:14:53.851 --> 00:14:56.395
<i>why didn't they hire more bodyguards?</i>

232
00:14:57.229 --> 00:15:00.232
<i>There are too many
questionable points in this mission.</i>

233
00:15:02.776 --> 00:15:04.445
What's that?

234
00:15:09.325 --> 00:15:10.576
Those clouds...

235
00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.870
They're a little creepy.

236
00:15:14.079 --> 00:15:15.289
I'll go check them out.

237
00:15:17.833 --> 00:15:19.376
Hey! Don't act on your own!

238
00:15:20.419 --> 00:15:21.837
Stay alert. Mimosa.

239
00:15:21.962 --> 00:15:23.464
Yes!

240
00:15:39.063 --> 00:15:39.939
Yuno!

241
00:15:40.022 --> 00:15:41.190
Protect the ship!

242
00:15:41.398 --> 00:15:42.608
That's what I intend to do.

243
00:15:50.199 --> 00:15:51.659
Take this!

244
00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.454
That was impressive!

245
00:16:38.247 --> 00:16:42.418
Those men from earlier
were not after Salim?

246
00:16:48.424 --> 00:16:50.092
Thank you for saving me back there.

247
00:16:50.217 --> 00:16:52.845
You're really good. Yuno.

248
00:16:53.053 --> 00:16:56.515
I didn't even have the chance
to use my God of Lightning Rising Salim.

249
00:16:57.349 --> 00:16:59.727
I'm getting more interested in you now.

250
00:17:00.352 --> 00:17:01.353
That's right.

251
00:17:01.437 --> 00:17:04.857
Why don't you take me
to your village for a visit?

252
00:17:05.482 --> 00:17:07.943
I want to see the place
where you were born and raised.

253
00:17:08.318 --> 00:17:12.448
I want to know what environment
you grew up in that made you so strong.

254
00:17:12.948 --> 00:17:15.993
Lord Salim. that'll result in a detour.

255
00:17:16.577 --> 00:17:20.748
Besides. there could be another attack
on the way like what happened just now.

256
00:17:21.081 --> 00:17:22.833
so we should head straight
for the Heart Kingdom--

257
00:17:22.958 --> 00:17:25.085
Even if there are people
trying to harm me.

258
00:17:25.169 --> 00:17:27.921
you guys will protect me. right?

259
00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:29.256
Well...

260
00:17:29.381 --> 00:17:30.215
Of course we will.

261
00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:33.218
But for nobles to go to the most remote
village of peasants. it's---

262
00:17:33.343 --> 00:17:35.679
It's okay. It'll just be a quick visit.

263
00:17:35.804 --> 00:17:36.889
Yes.

264
00:17:37.014 --> 00:17:39.683
I'm sure Yuno would like to go back
to his hometown after all this time

265
00:17:39.767 --> 00:17:42.311
and meet with everyone
back at the church too. right?

266
00:17:42.394 --> 00:17:44.021
That's not your concern.

267
00:17:44.146 --> 00:17:45.355
Don't be like this.

268
00:17:50.319 --> 00:17:52.863
So that's the demon's skull!

269
00:17:56.825 --> 00:17:58.994
It's massive.

270
00:17:59.203 --> 00:18:03.082
Is that a statue of the first
Magic Emperor on top of its head?

271
00:18:03.707 --> 00:18:05.125
I see.

272
00:18:05.334 --> 00:18:07.461
So where is the church?

273
00:18:07.961 --> 00:18:09.129
There.

274
00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:18.931
Yuno!

275
00:18:20.265 --> 00:18:21.683
Welcome back!

276
00:18:22.184 --> 00:18:23.352
I'm back.

277
00:18:23.685 --> 00:18:25.562
You've grown so much!

278
00:18:25.938 --> 00:18:27.356
I haven't changed.

279
00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:30.734
It's only been two months
since I left the village.

280
00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:33.529
Really? But...

281
00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:35.531
Right. it's your face.

282
00:18:35.614 --> 00:18:37.699
You look more mature now.

283
00:18:37.866 --> 00:18:39.368
What brings you here today?

284
00:18:39.618 --> 00:18:40.744
We're on a mission.

285
00:18:40.911 --> 00:18:42.621
so we came to pay a short visit.

286
00:18:43.122 --> 00:18:46.041
Why must I come
to this most remote village?

287
00:18:46.458 --> 00:18:48.168
Well. hello.

288
00:18:48.293 --> 00:18:49.920
I'm Sister Lily.

289
00:18:51.755 --> 00:18:54.299
I'm Klaus Lunettes
of the honorable Golden Dawn.

290
00:18:54.424 --> 00:18:57.302
led by William Vangeance.

291
00:18:57.427 --> 00:18:59.346
I'm a mentor to the new recruits.

292
00:18:59.471 --> 00:19:01.014
Okay. Mr. Klaus.

293
00:19:01.098 --> 00:19:03.183
Thank you for looking after Yuno.

294
00:19:03.308 --> 00:19:06.353
I've heard about your name
from Yuno's letters.

295
00:19:06.478 --> 00:19:07.646
Letters?

296
00:19:08.188 --> 00:19:10.190
What did you write about me?

297
00:19:12.276 --> 00:19:13.402
Jeez!

298
00:19:14.027 --> 00:19:15.654
I'm Mimosa Vermillion.

299
00:19:15.737 --> 00:19:17.364
I joined the squad
at the same time as Yuno.

300
00:19:17.489 --> 00:19:19.616
Yes. I've heard of you
from the letters too.

301
00:19:19.741 --> 00:19:20.868
I see.

302
00:19:20.993 --> 00:19:23.495
What did you write about me?

303
00:19:25.455 --> 00:19:27.040
She's so beautiful.

304
00:19:30.377 --> 00:19:33.130
I'm Salim Hapshass from Hapshass Village.

305
00:19:33.213 --> 00:19:35.757
son of Lord Hapshass of House of Lords.

306
00:19:35.883 --> 00:19:39.136
and the heir to the Hapshass family.

307
00:19:39.511 --> 00:19:41.597
Please remember my name.

308
00:19:41.805 --> 00:19:43.348
No!

309
00:19:44.725 --> 00:19:47.060
I'm so sorry! I unconsciously...

310
00:19:47.186 --> 00:19:49.855
No. it's all right. Sister Lily.

311
00:19:54.818 --> 00:19:57.237
-Yuno!
-It's Yuno!

312
00:19:57.362 --> 00:19:59.364
How have you been?

313
00:19:59.573 --> 00:20:01.074
Welcome back!

314
00:20:01.825 --> 00:20:03.327
What brings you here. Yuno?

315
00:20:03.452 --> 00:20:06.413
Amazing! That's the robe
of the Golden Dawn.

316
00:20:06.538 --> 00:20:07.789
It's the real thing!

317
00:20:07.915 --> 00:20:09.499
It's Yuno!

318
00:20:11.293 --> 00:20:12.753
Where's Asta?

319
00:20:12.878 --> 00:20:14.421
Where is Asta?

320
00:20:14.671 --> 00:20:16.757
Are you keeping in contact with Asta?

321
00:20:16.882 --> 00:20:17.966
No. I'm not.

322
00:20:18.175 --> 00:20:19.593
Are you staying the night tonight?

323
00:20:19.718 --> 00:20:21.011
You are. right?

324
00:20:21.136 --> 00:20:22.262
Well...

325
00:20:22.512 --> 00:20:25.224
Unfortunately. we're just stopping by.

326
00:20:25.641 --> 00:20:27.935
We have to hurry on our way.

327
00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.436
-What?
-What?

328
00:20:29.561 --> 00:20:30.729
Don't be like this.

329
00:20:30.812 --> 00:20:33.065
There's no need to be in such a hurry.

330
00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:35.484
We can spare an hour or so. right?

331
00:20:35.567 --> 00:20:36.693
But...

332
00:20:37.569 --> 00:20:39.905
Then I'll prepare some nomotato dishes.

333
00:20:39.988 --> 00:20:41.823
It's the specialty of Hage Village.

334
00:20:41.907 --> 00:20:43.659
Yuno. have some before you go.

335
00:20:44.159 --> 00:20:46.453
You guys should have some too. Come on in.

336
00:20:46.578 --> 00:20:49.081
What a magnificent church.

337
00:20:49.623 --> 00:20:52.542
This is my first time seeing
such a small church.

338
00:20:52.626 --> 00:20:53.961
How cute.

339
00:20:54.044 --> 00:20:55.087
Small?

340
00:20:55.212 --> 00:20:57.256
It's like a playhouse.

341
00:20:57.381 --> 00:20:58.590
What?

342
00:20:59.258 --> 00:21:02.052
Yuno. tell us about the Magic Knights.

343
00:21:02.177 --> 00:21:03.387
Tell us!

344
00:21:03.512 --> 00:21:04.805
Tell us!

345
00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:08.517
Why must I enter
such a filthy little church?

346
00:22:48.200 --> 00:22:50.619
<i>-Petite Clover!
-Petite Clover!</i>

347
00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:53.830
<i>Sekke's Haha Lecture.</i>

348
00:22:54.956 --> 00:22:56.666
We're still doing this?

349
00:22:57.250 --> 00:22:58.835
Of course we are. Asta.

350
00:22:59.169 --> 00:23:03.090
since you haven't mastered
the ways of Haha at all.

351
00:23:03.548 --> 00:23:05.759
Your Shooting Star's so cool!

352
00:23:05.884 --> 00:23:08.011
So you understand its value too!

353
00:23:08.136 --> 00:23:11.306
That front part is especially impressive!

354
00:23:11.431 --> 00:23:14.226
Good! You're starting
to master the ways of Haha!

355
00:23:14.351 --> 00:23:16.853
I see. So this is Haha.

356
00:23:16.978 --> 00:23:19.731
That's right.
Starting today. you're a Haha too.

357
00:23:23.693 --> 00:23:25.445
Men are so stupid.

358
00:23:28.323 --> 00:23:31.785
<i>Yuno. that jerk.
He's just a newbie but he's so insolent.</i>

359
00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:33.078
<i>I'm your senior!</i>

360
00:23:33.203 --> 00:23:34.538
<i>If you don't listen to me.</i>

361
00:23:34.663 --> 00:23:36.623
<i>my glasses are not going to remain silent!</i>

362
00:23:36.748 --> 00:23:38.542
Black Clover. <i>Page 13.</i>

363
00:23:38.625 --> 00:23:40.418
<i>"The Magic Emperor Saw. Continued."</i>

364
00:23:40.544 --> 00:23:41.837
<i>My magic is in never giving up!</i>

365
00:23:41.920 --> 00:23:42.921
Subtitle translation by Zoe Wong

365
00:23:43.305 --> 00:24:43.729
